qrt></math><br /><br />Hence,&nbsp;the minimum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mi>b</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>.&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mi>b</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>"
